		(descr "PixArt PMW3610DM-SUDU low power laser mouse sensor, 16-pin molded lead-frame DIP, 1.78 mm pitch, rows 10.70 mm apart; pads and the aperture for the LM18-LSI lens from the datasheet (Figure 5). Origin at the optical center. The sensor sits on this side, the lens on the other side through the aperture, 2.4 mm (2.2-2.6) from its reference plane to the tracking surface. The lens outline (other side Fab/CrtYd) is the aperture plus 0.5 mm between the pad rows, an assumption: no LM18-LSI drawing was found.")
